      "writtenOn": "2013-07-02T06:09:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "RBAC does not change regardless how the user is authenticated. Currently REMOTE_USER simply means Keystone does not need to authenticate the user again. Once authenticated, user will get a token, which is no different then user authenticated an Keystone internal mechanism (i.e. username/password).",
